+## CORS
+
+The totem's web build runs on a local static server in development. The
+`api/*` paths answer CORS (`config/cors.php`) for origins
+`http(s)://localhost[:port]` and `http(s)://127.0.0.1[:port]`, plus the optional
+`TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN` env value. Any other origin gets **no**
+`Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header. No credentials
+(`Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` is never sent). A preflight
+`OPTIONS /api/totem/auth` from `http://localhost:8081` answers `204` with
+`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:8081`. Paths outside `api/*`
+are unaffected.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+Operator UI for presets/pairing, billing/subscription checks
